  <section class="section"><div class="container prose no-image"><section class="prose-section"><h2>The official hospital logo</h2><p>The winged-horse Dr BRC Circadian Hospital logo was provided by hospital management. Website-size copies preserve the supplied artwork and colours.</p></section><section class="prose-section"><h2>Dr BRC’s education work</h2><p>Clock, speaking and training photographs are from the <a class="text-link" href="https://biswaroop.com/gallery/">official Dr BRC gallery</a>, showing a training event in Malaysia on 21 August 2025. They do not depict the Faridabad premises.</p></section><section class="prose-section"><h2>DIP Diet illustrations</h2><p>Fruit and vegetable artwork is sourced from <a class="text-link" href="https://biswaroop.com/dipdiet/">Dr BRC’s published DIP Diet guide</a>. It is educational imagery, not a photograph of a hospital meal or a personal prescription.</p></section></div></section>
